Description: Voice dictation for Linux GNOME
 FrogScribe is a voice dictation application for Linux GNOME desktops.
 Press a global hotkey, speak, and your words are transcribed using
 on-device AI (whisper.cpp) and inserted at the cursor position.
 Features include hold-to-talk, streaming live preview, long-form
 dictation, automatic transcription, local AI summarization via Phi-3,
 text refinement, and a GNOME Shell extension panel indicator.
